Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, my love, Moi Moi\NKune, a fortuitous moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart goes thump for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan's first ever maid, Omoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In early Meiji, when social stratification\Nwas still ingrained in society?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She served all masters\Nwithout distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and enamored the people of Akiyo\NNahara with love and violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After her death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an annual festival called the Lady Omoi\NClimb was established in her honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a fighting festival\Nwhere maids compete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be the best of the\Nbest in the name of honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride, and respect.
