Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.10,0:02:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(442,562)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Akiba Creatures Go Wild!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.10,0:02:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(931.4,560.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Let the Moe Festivities Begin!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I hear you've been\Nraking it in recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, there's some\Nshady rumors out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear your cafe's bringing\Nin clients by dealing drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Little Teddy here\Ndoesn't believe any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if Miss Nagi were to catch\Nwind of such a rumor you know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what killed the bear I'll have\Nyou stuffed bring it on cat girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll skin that pretty hide of yours\Nand make some slippers out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit down yes ma 'am
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This year's Akiba maid festival\Nwill be special in that the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creature land group will be the\Nsole organizer That's great news,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that those pesky ETs are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a single group organize the\Nfestival is a first in Akiba history.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the Mistress climb, we will\Nbe overseeing the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So therefore, all the cafes\Nmust know that Dazzlion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Nagi's cafe, is supposed to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will show Akiba that we are the\Nultimate ecosystem of creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Awesome! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Lady Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all get to climb her at\Nthe end of the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think maids kicking and\Nfighting each other is fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maid who reaches the top first\Nbecomes Lady Omoe for the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means better priority in the\Ngroup and more customers for her cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we should totally go for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The starting order for the Lady\NOmoe climb is based on food sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last year, the race was over before\Nwe even got to the starting line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we work really hard\Non the food stall, then we...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I thought I smelt\Nswine flesh. No wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are you trying to say, swine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you even talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You greedy hogs have been\Nrather a piggy recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it uppity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple of newbies put some silly ideas\Ninto those swollen heads of yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you pigs are always\Nat the bottom of the heap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have at it with\Nnon-affiliates all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you comply to\Nthe creature pecking order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, kachimachi! Water! We need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they be so awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just what we get as\Na cafe ranked dead last.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.83,0:04:32.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(398.4,211.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pig's Feet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hardly run into maids from other\Naffiliated cafes outside the festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they love getting the chance\Nto make fun of us every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you two to\Nput up with trash talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in going\Nagainst a higher ranked cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want another bloody\Nturf war on our hands, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no, I guess not, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get this tent up\Nand go help Bronco and the others.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.10,0:04:50.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1062.4,345.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.10,0:04:50.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1062,393)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ecosystem Guidelines
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the guidelines\Nfor this year's festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read it over thoroughly. Okay, creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, this year's\Nfestival is a special one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read every single word carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make sure to beat them into\Nthe heads of your pigsty maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better make sure your\Ntiny pig brains understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, so teeny-weeny. Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome back.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(932.8,113.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pig's Feet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(920.4,620.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pig's Feet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pig's feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we sold colored piglets last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colored piglets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why sell those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other festival\Nstalls like shaved ice and candy apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The higher-ranked cafes\Ntake all the good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too bottom-rung to\Nget to do anything cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottom-rung?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, they say pig's feet\Nare a great source of collagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she mean by bottom rung? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our group has what they\Ncall the moi-moi hierarchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and our cafe is ranked at the very bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we ranked so low?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cafes that do dirty work for the\Nhigher-ups, or offer lots of honey money,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or have a bond of sisterhood with\Na better cafe are ranked high.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have none of that, so\Nwe're down at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand the structure. Bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we cut this talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real total buzzkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to stick it out for the\Nfestival and just keep our heads down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya, can you break down\Nand bundle the empty boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(913.2,82.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(810.8,133)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ecosystem Guidelines
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you worried that\Nwe might actually lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just devised a brilliant\Nplan to ensure total
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,line victory What is Miss\NNagi worried about then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the king of beasts\Nafter all We don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your stupid plan to win\Nthe Lady Omaway Climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your victory will surely be indisputable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is but a formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go tell Miss Nagi that we lions will\Nshow her an elegant victory indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maurice! Maurice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an honor, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(161.6,512)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink-y-doink. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm running a final check about\Nthe guidelines I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust your maids all know the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh of course they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pigs were to violate\Nthe terms in the guidelines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will disown you along\Nwith all the other dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap. Crap. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it was here, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.01,0:07:34.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(840.4,136.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pig's Feet
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks flashier than yesterday,\Nhuh? Oh! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a festival, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame to have\Nto keep our heads down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we make lots of masters happy, I'm\Nsure it will be that much more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been at this since the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face is smudged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wipe it off later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we might as well\Nenjoy the festival, dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cuter, so better, I say! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.29,0:08:05.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(475.2,284.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pig's Feet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco is something wrong I hope not have\Nyou guys seen the chief anywhere huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it doesn't make a difference\Neither way come on let's sell some
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pig's feet man, I feel bad about this.\NThey're probably all panicking right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now With me missing oh fishy now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,welcome home welcome home all masters and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We truly appreciate seeing such a\Nlarge turnout for today's festivities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single maid cafe in\NAkiba is gathered here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cover every genre of moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So today, the sky's the limit for moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A moe moe festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moe till you drop.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.83,0:08:45.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732.8,170.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Akiba Maid Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Akiba Maid Festival begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pig's feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, uh, I need to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The port-a-potties are\Nall that way, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not here to point out\Nthe port-a-potties, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been how many times now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the 26th time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Runko, I just love pig's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you wrap up two pigs worth for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gladly, Master. Please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That customer's totally\Nafter Ronco, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been at the cafe a lot recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think he's super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop by the cafe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We eagerly await your\Nreturn to the pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he put into your bowl, Ronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what pigs love best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a pig's foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Detectives are first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, masters! I'm glad you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We searched all over the venue for your\Nstall, but we couldn't find you on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, may I take a look at that, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.68,0:10:22.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1056,799)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}O
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think this might be us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it all stand for Port-O-Potties?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they keep asking\Nus where the bathroom is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they really don't give\Na crap about us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder no one's coming to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not going to come to\Nus, we'll just go out to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come get some pig feet from Oinky Doon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freshly chopped off, ripe pig feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're hogalicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your pig feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh pig feet from Oinky Doon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fresh pig's feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your porking manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really suck at life, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good has ever happened\Nto you your entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think so? Sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll figure things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're smart girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't need you\Naround fucking it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, no one's out\Nlooking for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and just make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will after I catch a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bozos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your manager? Tell us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something we can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pig head was walking around\Nsnorting and selling stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we ram those pig's feet in\Nyour ears and rattle your molars around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:11:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:11:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're wanting a beating, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now’s not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This scared little piggy here is smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows her place in the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands on the ground, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, Yumechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went out there all of my own! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think your groveling\Nactually means anything, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry the hell up. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi, don't do it! It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a hoofprint for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way you won't forget\Nyour place, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare leave your pigs die again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pigs are supposed to keep their noses\Nto the ground and stay rooting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, maybe you'll find a\Ntruffle or something once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have gone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have stayed put.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we fight back, they'll\Nclose us down this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get why Oinky Doink\Nis on the bottom rung?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I see it, you're all top-notch maids!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we're top-notch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's right, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi has given up\Nbeing human in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shippon is crazy hyper and ready to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Zoya is so much better at smiling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's ketchup doodles\Naren't awful anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're better than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Okachimachi is a real panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all really amazing maids!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, let us prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we do that, Zoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an easy answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think\Nour pig's feet are for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moimoy QQN! Moimoy QQN!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moimoy QQN!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moimoy QQN! Moimoy QQN!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moimoy QQN maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, we have the highest\Nattendance in the history of the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go over the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids who contribute to the group\Nwill gain wealth, fame, and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids who fail will get cast to\Nthe bottom to serve as a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made sure to ingrain\Nthe Moe-Moe hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will definitely benefit the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now the Creatureland\Ngroup's ecosystem is undivided.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akiba itself is a creature that thrives\Noff of people's innate yearning for greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, today I'll prove that\NI'm at the apex of Akiba.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.73,0:14:44.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1108.4,145.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Akiba Maid Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of Akiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, huffers, got the\Nguidelines in your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make things look extremely\Nclose and make sure the lions win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:15:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're goners if we take\Neven a single step out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Moo Moo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to win it this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going for the win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moo! Moo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's win round! Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll show them, this year's different!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show them what pigs\Nare made of! Okie dokie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masters and mistresses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please cheer them on until the bones in\Nyour throat get pulverized into dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they start running, they can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything goes from Moe Moe to Bashity\NBash, a festival melee, the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lady of Moe Climb is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moe, Moe, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we allowed to go yet, Rocco?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sounded the gun a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason we should\Nhave to wait quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy spin, pig mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you retry the\Necosystem into your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes Doon! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big go-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think I know that, Kefé. Those pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fucking pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comply with the ecosystem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick to the guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fucking swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the underdogs trying\Nto win this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't change the fact\Nthat the lions will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's okay for\Nyou damn pigs to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, like we give a care!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you read the damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like hell we're gonna read the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yimachi! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll climb a tree if\Nyou flatter them enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll make you quit that silly snorting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first catch of the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogome?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a good pig and back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a salmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is full already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hogs should stick to selling\Npig speed by the port-a-potties!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the pig's foot you ordered\Nright here, mistress. Runco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are done here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Runco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, allow me to send you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, our ecosystem's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for a real hectic time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oink and Doon,\NCaptain! Yeah! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fucking pigs. At the top of the ecosystem
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much the time has\Nnow come we will award the winner
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the lady omoe climb Our new\Nlady omoe maid will stand at the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very pinnacle of all akiba maids\Nfor the coming year She will
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,provide her very special service to\Nall of you masters and mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here now, to present the\Nofficious lady on my own title,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:21:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the head representative\Nof the Creatureland Group,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress Nagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head representative?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gone and done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she said for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprising result.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have plenty of promise, Pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Madam Creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Oinky-Doy! Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether this newfound maid standing here\Nis truly worthy of being Our Lady Boom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a question we will all soon find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.77,0:21:37.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,659)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This Year's
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.77,0:21:37.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(757,713.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Lady Omoe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagomi from Oinky-Doy Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masters, mistresses, we eagerly\Nawait your return to our pigsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of our maids!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who's making the speech now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I practically raised her.
